{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Command the children of Israel, and they shall send out, etc.</b> The reason for the juxtaposition of this passage to the one before it is that since HaShem commanded the separation of the Levites from consecrated things and assigned the priests over them, as stated in the preceding passage, He likewise imposed upon Israel the separation of those who are unfit to enter their holy camps."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:06:09.849637684Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}